# Class-table features are rules text unless an explicit PCGen numeric grant is present.
Armiger Talents Per Customized Weapon (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_ARMIGER_TALENTS_PER_CUSTOMIZED_WEAPON|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ARMIGER_TALENTS_PER_CUSTOMIZED_WEAPON|1*if(SPHERES_ARMIGER_LEVEL>=1,1,0)+1*if(SPHERES_ARMIGER_LEVEL>=3,1,0)+1*if(SPHERES_ARMIGER_LEVEL>=7,1,0)+1*if(SPHERES_ARMIGER_LEVEL>=11,1,0)+1*if(SPHERES_ARMIGER_LEVEL>=15,1,0)+1*if(SPHERES_ARMIGER_LEVEL>=19,1,0)	DESC:%SPHERES_ARMIGER_TALENTS_PER_CUSTOMIZED_WEAPON talents assigned separately to each customized weapon; do not add to the general combat talent pool; consult class rules before applying in play.
Armiger Class Features 1	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 1: Combat training, customized weapons (3 weapons), quick change. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 2	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 2: Prowess. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 3	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 3: Focusing switch. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 4	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 4: Prowess. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 5	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 5: Enhanced customization +1, rapid assault. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
