Armiger Class Features 9	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 9: Enhanced customization +2. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 10	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 10: Prowess. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 11	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 11: Customized weapons (4 weapons). See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 12	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 12: Prowess. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 13	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 13: Enhanced customization +3. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 14	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 14: Prowess. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 15	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 15: Lightning assault. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 16	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 16: Prowess. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 17	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 17: Enhanced customization +4. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 18	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 18: Prowess. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Armiger Class Features 19	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 19: Customized weapons (5 weapons). See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/armiger for effects, timing and prerequisites.
